<p>
  <strong>Server-Side Filtering</strong>
</p>
<p>Only <strong>Active</strong> records (Sales_Issue_Active_Indicator__c = true) that are currently in date (Sales_Issue_Valid_From__c &lt;= TODAY AND Sales_Issue_Valid_To__c &gt;= TODAY) are considered, ordered by Rule Prioritization Number ascending (lowest number at top), With limit of 4000 rows.</p>
<ul>
  <li data-uuid="48192350-a5b2-4fad-9a75-6290451882b9">
    <strong>Always AND:</strong> Service Type, Remedy Type, Sales Org, Return Reason, Sold To CMF, Return Location Plant, Received Condition - a blank value on the matrix row acts as a wildcard for that field.</li>
  <li data-uuid="8b153158-40a6-4e27-aa6a-e8be50861116">
    <strong>Non-IAO adds (AND):</strong> Item Product Code, Operation Business Unit Code.</li>
  <li data-uuid="b0e5e4ba-cf49-4492-baec-8df89671a2b5">
    <strong>IAO adds (OR):</strong> Profit Center <em>or</em> Item Market Name - only one of the two needs to match, not both.</li>
</ul>
<p>
  <strong>How it is Used</strong>
</p>
<ul>
  <li data-uuid="648e3da1-e9fe-4e14-a27b-e18255c6bdbc">
    <strong>Case-level:</strong> the client takes the first record returned (the highest-priority match). If that record's Sales_Issue_Pending_Indicator__c is true, the case Status is set to Pending Agent Action instead of proceeding to Submitted.</li>
  <li data-uuid="12399cb8-5daa-4a95-b905-298fe7853a01">
    <strong>Line-item level:</strong> getReasonForPending() separately finds, for each line item, a matrix record whose Received Condition / Product Code / Operation Business Unit Code either match the line or are blank on the rule. When found, it stamps a human-readable message on Line_item_error_messages__c, eg "Pending Reason: Pending Matrix Rule Number 10, Matching with following criteria Sales Org,Service Type,CMF"  the criteria list is built from whichever fields are populated on the matched rule (Sales Org, Service Type, Remedy Type, Return Reason, CMF, Business Unit Code, Disti Channel, Prod Code, Plant, Receipt Condition).</li>
</ul>
<p>If no Pending Matrix record matches, or the matched record has Sales_Issue_Pending_Indicator__c = false, the case status is left as-is and submission proceeds normally — this is a soft check, not a hard stop.</p>


